{
 "id": "ANM-12",
 "name": "like-pop",
 "version": 2,
 "title": "Like button pop",
 "summary": "A heart that pops when tapped: the tap records animationTime() in @tapAt and toggles @liked; the heart's scale overshoots and settles from the time since the tap, an impulse starting at @tapAt draws an expanding ring, and a wakeIn asks for frames only during the 0.6 s pop.",
 "prompt": "A like button: tapping the outlined heart fills it red with a quick pop (it grows and settles back) and a ring that bursts outward; tapping again un-likes it.",
 "level": 4,
 "family": "ANM",
 "capabilities": {
  "primary": [
   "anim.trigger"
  ],
  "secondary": [
   "time.impulse",
   "doc.fps",
   "draw.path",
   "draw.transform",
   "expr.shaping",
   "expr.trig",
   "input.toggle",
   "a11y.labels"
  ]
 },
 "use_cases": [
  "control"
 ],
 "form_factor": "square",
 "keywords": [
  "like",
  "heart",
  "favorite",
  "pop",
  "burst",
  "micro interaction",
  "tap feedback",
  "bounce on tap",
  "one-shot"
 ],
 "teaches": [
  "Start a one-shot animation from a tap by storing the tap time: valueFloatExpressionChange tapAt = animationTime(), then p = clamp(0, 1, (animationTime() - @tapAt) / 0.45)",
  "Pop with scale 1.6 + 0.5 · sin(π·p) · (1 - p): up fast, back to rest exactly when p reaches 1",
  "Draw extra effects only during the pop with an impulse whose start is @tapAt, and request frames with wakeIn only until it ends"
 ],
 "pitfalls": [
  "animationTime() alone never repaints (U6) and an impulse asks for no repaint: the wakeIn \"0.016 + 3600 * step(animationTime() - @tapAt, 0.6)\" supplies the frames",
  "Initialise tapAt in the past (-10) so nothing pops on load",
  "An impulseProcess skips the first frame of its window; keep the main shape (the heart) outside the impulse so it is always drawn",
  "Centre a drawing made at the header's coordinates with one translate from componentWidth()/componentHeight(): the host may give the canvas any size"
 ],
 "snippets": [
  {
   "pointer": "/root/2/canvas/modifiers/3",
   "shows": "input.toggle",
   "note": "onClick: liked = 1 - liked, tapAt = animationTime()"
  },
  {
   "pointer": "/root/2/canvas/commands/2",
   "shows": "anim.trigger",
   "note": "s = 1.6 + 0.5 sin(πp)(1 - p): the pop"
  },
  {
   "pointer": "/root/2/canvas/commands/4",
   "shows": "time.impulse",
   "note": "impulse 0.5 s from @tapAt: the expanding ring"
  },
  {
   "pointer": "/root/2/canvas/commands/0",
   "shows": "doc.fps",
   "note": "wakeIn every frame for 0.6 s after the tap"
  }
 ],
